# Minimise the predictive-autoscaler build context (ml/Dockerfile builds from the
# repo root). Exclude everything, then re-include only what the image needs:
# the ml/ package (code + models/*.pt) and the trained scaler.
# NOTE: the app image builds from its own spring-workload-simulator/ context, so
# this file does not affect it.
*
!ml
!data
data/**
!data/processed
data/processed/**
!data/processed/scaler.json
!data/processed_eks
data/processed_eks/**
!data/processed_eks/scaler.json
